<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第二幕 · 模型外面那一圈里头</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>拿一次真实执行，把这三道关问一遍</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 32}}><Box style={{width: 620, flexDirection: "column", padding: 26, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.05)", borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: "3px solid #1C1F23"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", lineHeight: 1.9}}>$ agent run --fix flaky-test</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.9}}>[step 1] read   src/order/repo.go</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.9}}>[step 2] shell  go test ./...</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.9}}>[step 3] write  src/order/repo.go</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "#A32D2D", lineHeight: 1.9}}>[step 4] shell  git push origin main</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", lineHeight: 1.9}}>[step 5] exit 0</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 500, flexDirection: "column", gap: 12, justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(163,45,45,0.06)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 600, color: "#A32D2D"}}>这一步谁批的？</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8}}>提议方自己签的字</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(163,45,45,0.06)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 600, color: "#A32D2D"}}>它在哪台机器上跑的？</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8}}>执行端没有独立授权</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(163,45,45,0.06)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 600, color: "#A32D2D"}}>这一步记下来了吗？</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8}}>事后无法还原</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>19 / 37</Text></Box></Box>
